# Visualization Standards

## Style Requirements

- **Background**: Use a white background
- **Colors**: High-contrast colors (colorblind-friendly)
- **Fonts**: Large fonts suitable for printing
- **Format**: Save as PDF (.pdf) for vector quality

## Content Requirements

- Every axis **MUST** have a label and unit
- Every plot **MUST** have a title (or handle it in LaTeX caption)

## Output Format

Save as PDF (.pdf) for vector quality.

## LaTeX Output

When generating the plot code, also generate the LaTeX snippet:

```latex
\begin{figure}[htbp]
\centering
\includegraphics[width=0.8\textwidth]{images/filename.pdf}
\caption{Detailed description of what the trend implies.}
\label{fig:filename}
\end{figure}
```
